@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant "edit:EditAppointmentCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

Logic -> Model : createCheckpoint()
Model --> Logic : checkpoint
Logic -> Command : execute(model)
Command -> Model : getFilteredAppointmentList()
Model --> Command : displayed appointments
opt c/ supplied
    Command -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
    Model --> Command : displayed clients
end
note over Command
Parser has validated all supplied fields.
Build one complete replacement.
For d/, retain the original duration.
end note
alt all supplied values unchanged
    Command --> Logic : CommandResult.withoutSave(advisory)
    note over Logic : Return success without writing or changing history.
else changed
    Command -> Model : setAppointment(target, replacement)
    note over Model
Validate the full schedule before mutation.
Reject clashes; otherwise replace and commit once.
Preserve active filters.
end note
    Model --> Command
    Command --> Logic : CommandResult(updated details)
    Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(addressBook)
    alt saved
        Storage --> Logic : success
    else write failed
        Storage --> Logic : IOException
        Logic -> Model : restoreCheckpoint(checkpoint)
        Model --> Logic : data, filters and history restored
    end
end
@enduml
